(F5 T2 V7: materi_strain_plasti_camclay / _mohr_coul / _tension / _vonmises
 (manual Professional 4.34, 4.41-4.43) on the model of plasti_apply1 without plasti_apply (plastic): the dof of the
 group's model (mohr_coul) equals materi_strain_plasti at every node, the other
 three stay 0 (scripts/build_safe.sh). The Professional 02-08-2026 adds no
 dof for these initialisations and rejects _camclay (DIVERGENCES
 STRAIN-PLASTI-MODEL-DOFS).)
(plasti_apply -no, manual Pro 6.899: Mohr-Coulomb data ignored, result equals
 the elastic model. Pro 02-08-2026: sigyy -21.978; with plasticity -3.39)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
materi_strain_plasti
materi_strain_plasti_camclay
materi_strain_plasti_mohr_coul
materi_strain_plasti_tension
materi_strain_plasti_vonmises
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_materi_plasti_mohr_coul 0 0.5 1. 0.
geometry_line 1 0 0 1 0 0.01
geometry_line 2 0 0 0 1 0.01
geometry_line 3 0 1 1 1 0.01
bounda_dof 0 -geometry_line 1 -vely
bounda_dof 1 -geometry_line 2 -velx
bounda_dof 2 -geometry_line 3 -vely
bounda_time 2 0 -0.02 100 -0.02
control_timestep 0 0.1 1.
end_data
